Package: libsimpleitk2.5
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: simplified layer on top of the Insight Toolkit (runtime)
 SimpleITK is a simplified, procedural programming interface to the Insight
 Toolkit (ITK) for biomedical image analysis: registration, segmentation,
 filtering and I/O, exposed through a consistent API.
 .
 This package provides the SimpleITK C++ runtime libraries.

