 ${misc:Depends},
Description: simplified layer on top of the Insight Toolkit (development files)
 SimpleITK is a simplified, procedural programming interface to the Insight
 Toolkit (ITK) for biomedical image analysis.
 .
 This package provides the headers and CMake configuration for developing
 C++ applications against SimpleITK.

